0..76 Comment "// Hello, world: a program printing a line through `std`, handed the ambient"
77..105 Comment "// authority by `gandr run`."
106..108 Comment "//"
109..183 Comment "// Authority enters a program in one place, as `main`\'s parameter, and the"
184..258 Comment "// program prints through a capability opened from it. Nothing reaches the"
259..330 Comment "// standard streams through the ambient `std.io.Console.Eff` interface."
331..333 Comment "//"
334..412 Comment "// `console` narrows the authority to the standard streams, and `print` writes"
413..489 Comment "// one line through them. `gandr run hello.gandr` prints `hello, world!` and"
490..501 Comment "// exits 0."
502..504 Comment "//"
505..577 Comment "// - see: `../../../library/std/src/authority.gandr` — `Authority` and"
578..592 Comment "//   `console`"
593..650 Comment "// - see: `../../../library/std/src/io.gandr` — `print`"
651..699 Comment "// - see: #2970 — `std.authority` and `std.io`"
701..761 Comment "// The authority `main` is handed, and the console it opens."
